459
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:39,680
Ah, sí, jo que podríem dir lo dels animals. Vore tant d'animal al carrer.

460
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:42,680
Animal al carrer viu, mort o de totes maneres?

461
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:43,680
Viu i mort i...

462
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:45,680
